ditorState": "<p style=\"font-size:32px;\">In Manchester, where__________, lots of kids play football.</p>", "labelEditorState": null}], "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{\"text\":[{\"text\":\"At the weekend, when__________, we went to the cinema.\",\"fontSize\":\"32\"},{\"text\":\"My brother, who__________, is older.\",\"fontSize\":\"32\"},{\"text\":\"These bikes, which__________, are painted gold.\",\"fontSize\":\"32\"},{\"text\":\"The witch’s ball, that__________, slowly rolled off the shelf.\",\"fontSize\":\"32\"},{\"text\":\"The girl, whose__________, climbed quickly down the cliff. \",\"fontSize\":\"32\"},{\"text\":\"The merman for whom__________ swam away yesterday.\",\"fontSize\":\"32\"},{\"text\":\"In Manchester, where__________, lots of kids play football.\",\"fontSize\":\"32\"}]}", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 44047378, "text": "Possible Ways to Add Words in the Middle", "modal": {"steps": [{"id": 44047289, "text": "Here are the words we added in the middle of the sentences:\n<br></br>\nAt the weekend, <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">when</span> <b>it was raining</b>, we went to the cinema.\n<br>My brother, <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">who</span> <b>lives in Japan</b>, is older.\n<br>These bikes, <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">which</span> <b>have fifteen gears</b>, are painted gold.\n<br>The witch’s ball, <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">that</span> <b>had been still for four long weeks</b>, slowly rolled off the shelf.\n<br>The girl, <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">whose</span> <b>eyes kept scanning the sky</b>, climbed quickly down the cliff. \n<br>The merman for <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">whom</span> <b>you have been searching</b> swam away yesterday.\n<br>In Manchester, <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">where</span> <b>I live</b>, lots of kids play football.\n", "order": 1, "btnType": null,